# Scroll-to-text-fragment (#:~:text=...) not targetting a single HTML element, Lychee cannot resolve this yet
https://content.raptorservices.com/help-center/user-tracking-understanding-soft-ids-hard-ids-raptor-identity-matching#:~:text=IDs%3A-,UserId%20%28Website%20ID
